{"id":"202d3cae13e0389b","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-truth-table.md","title":"Truth-table 可约","display":"df-truth-table — Truth-table 可约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-truth-table","aliases":["20-df-truth-table"],"display":"df-truth-table — Truth-table 可约","chapter":"3","section":"3.8","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 3.8.2；Remark 3.8.3","source_pdf_pages":[110],"source_printed_pages":[74],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-truth-table"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-truth-table</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-table — Truth-table 可约"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.8"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.8.2；Remark 3.8.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>110</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>74</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；有限串以 df-strings 的 code 编码。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\\)</span> 是集合之间的 truth-table 归约关系，见上游 truth-table。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\exists g\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[(\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in2^{h(x)}\\ g(x,\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma))\\in2)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\chi_A(x)=g(x,\\operatorname{code}(\\chi_B\\upharpoonright h(x)))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\exists g\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[(\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in2^{h(x)}\\ g(x,\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma))\\in2)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\chi_A(x)=g(x,\\operatorname{code}(\\chi_B\\upharpoonright h(x)))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一量词简写表示对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\omega\">\\(x\\in\\omega\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{h(x)}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{h(x)}\\)</span>。每一行都有预先计算的答案，包括与实际 oracle 不同的行。修复原书排印式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(i)\">\\(g(i)\\)</span> 未显式携带输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的记号省略。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.8.2；Remark 3.8.3；印刷页 74；PDF 第 110 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\exists g\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[(\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in2^{h(x)}\\ g(x,\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma))\\in2)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\chi_A(x)=g(x,\\operatorname{code}(\\chi_B\\upharpoonright h(x)))].","display":true},{"tex":"x\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{h(x)}","display":false},{"tex":"g(i)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":1688,"backlinks":[{"id":"d12aec25b5426f2f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。"},{"id":"948261c4fe40ffdc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]。"},{"id":"f222b74804c56f9b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-deficiency]]；see [[20-df-hypersimple]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]。"},{"id":"c4e71acf1bfafb59","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-thm-truth-table]]。"},{"id":"c209552a90f2623f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-df-bounded-reducibility]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-change-set]]；see [[20-df-oracle